Package: opnform
Version: __APP_VERSION__
Architecture: __ARCH__
Section: web
Priority: optional
Maintainer: __MAINTAINER__
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), systemd
Description: Open-source form builder, fully self-hosted on your NAS
 EasyForm is an open-source form builder: create forms by drag and drop,
 collect responses and analyze results — your data never leaves your network.
 .
 Based on OpnForm (https://github.com/OpnForm/OpnForm), AGPL-3.0.
 .
 Bundled private runtime (PHP 8.3 / Node 24 / PostgreSQL 16 / Redis 7 / nginx)
 under /usr/local/opnform/depends; no system packages are modified.
